      "en": "A free interactive Grade 2 grammar activity: at Pearl's Doubling Pond, some words change in a special way when there is more than one — foot becomes feet, child becomes children, and a few (like deer and sheep) stay the same. Read the word, then pick the right plural — not the lazy +s. A friendly first look at irregular plural nouns. Common Core L.2.1.b.",
